{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "26d4debf-617b-8291-9763-8b334fb44025",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T10:45:35-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nadia Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:42:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:42:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I'm calling about a, um, a birth certificate. A certified copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:42:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Was the birth here in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. No, it was in Fall River. Massachusetts. So my question is, can I get that record here? Through your office? Or do I have to go to the other town."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:42:52-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Generally we only issue records for births, marriages and deaths that happened in Newport. For a Fall River birth you'd go through their city clerk or the Massachusetts registry of vital records."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So not here. Not here at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:43:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, not from this office. Now if the person was born in Newport, or you needed a marriage record from here, that we could do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:43:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's the Fall River one. I just wanted to be sure before I drove over. I was going to come in today, actually."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:43:31-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm glad you called first, then. It's a mess out there anyway, that snow turned to rain this morning and everything's slush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:43:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is wet. Very wet. I came out to the stoop to look and went right back in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:43:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. Don't blame you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:43:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask about the fee? What do they charge, generally? For a certified copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:43:59-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I couldn't tell you what Fall River charges, it's their fee schedule and it can change. Their clerk's office will have the exact amount, and the state site lists theirs too. Ours I can quote if you ever need a Newport record, but for yours, call them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:44:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'll call them. Do they take requests by mail? Or only in person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:44:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most offices do both, but I'd confirm with them. Some want a copy of your ID with a mail request, so have that handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:44:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "ID. Okay. A copy of my ID. I'll ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:44:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's usually the main thing. And it helps to have the full name on the record and the date of birth, and the parents' names if you know them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:44:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I know them. I have all of that. It's a, um, a family record I need. Not a mystery."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, then you're set. Anything else I can look up for you while I've got you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:45:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all. Well, one thing. I like it here in summer. From my stoop I watch the tourists on the weekends. Weekends. It's very entertaining. That's all, I just thought of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:45:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I bet it is. Front row seat. Well, you stay dry today and enjoy the quiet till then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:45:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Thank you, Sandra. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T10:45:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now, take care."
    }
  ],
